        "content": "<p>I'm thinking of doing some metaprogramming for FirstOrder.Language to make it easier to specify formulas (instead of the potentially more error-prone chasing of indices in BoundedFormulas, I'm thinking of something much closer to natural language). I kinda stepped into some traps early and I'm hitting some sort of soft wall figuring out the types. Just to double check that I'm not duplicating effort, is there already code for this?</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Data</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Defs</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ModelTheory</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Basic</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ModelTheory</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Syntax</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FirstOrder</span>\n\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">check</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Syntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- Syntax. autocomplete</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">declare_syntax_cat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fol_term</span>\n<span class=\"n\">declare_syntax_cat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fol_term_seq</span>\n<span class=\"n\">declare_syntax_cat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fol_formula</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">-- all cases for fol formulas</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">syntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ident</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fol_term</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">syntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fol_term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fol_term_seq</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">syntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fol_term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\",\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fol_term_seq</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fol_term_seq</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">syntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ident</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"F(\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fol_term_seq</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\")\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fol_term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- needs to be different to differentiate</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">syntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fol_term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"=\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fol_term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fol_formula</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">syntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ident</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"R(\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fol_term_seq</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\")\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fol_formula</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">syntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"(\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fol_formula</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"∧\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fol_formula</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\")\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fol_formula</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">syntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"(\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fol_formula</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"∨\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fol_formula</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\")\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fol_formula</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">syntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"(\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fol_formula</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"→\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fol_formula</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\")\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fol_formula</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">syntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"¬\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fol_formula</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fol_formula</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">syntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"∀\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ident</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\",\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fol_formula</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fol_formula</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">syntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"∃\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ident</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\",\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fol_formula</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fol_formula</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">mutual</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"c1\">-- idea: stores a list of terms to be put into a function</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"c1\">-- problem: a term is dependent on other terms (identifier String) or functions (identifier String + arity Nat)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"c1\">-- probably can combine the two, taking (str, 0) as a term instead of a function, but potentially might be harder.</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"c1\">-- I want the output to be a way to specify the functions, then output the list of Language.Term</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">partial</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">denoteFolTermSeq</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Language</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TSyntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`fol_term_seq</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">Σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">fs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">funs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"o\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fs</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">fol_term_seq</span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">fol_term</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">fol_term_seq</span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">fol_term</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">fol_term_seq</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"c1\">-- idea: stores a term</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"c1\">-- same problem as FolTermSeq</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">partial</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">denoteFolTerm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Language</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TSyntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`fol_term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">Σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">fs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">funs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"o\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">funs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">Σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Fin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fs</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">fol_term</span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">ident</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cons</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">raw</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">getAtomVal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">empty</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">disjoint_singleton_left</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">⦃</span><span class=\"n\">x_1</span><span class=\"o\">⦄</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a_1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a_1</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">refine</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">fs</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">empty</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">?_⟩</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">refine</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">var</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">raw</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">getAtomVal</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mem_cons_self</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">raw</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">getAtomVal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">empty</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">fol_term</span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">ident</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">fol_term_seq</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ty</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">denoteFolTermSeq</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">funs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">biUnion</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">range</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span>\n<span class=\"w\">          </span><span class=\"k\">match</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span>\n<span class=\"w\">          </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cons</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">raw</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">getAtomVal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">empty</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">disjoint_singleton_left</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">⦃</span><span class=\"n\">x_1</span><span class=\"o\">⦄</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a_1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a_1</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">          </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">succ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ty</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">2</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">1</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">refine</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">ty</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">1</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">funs</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">?_⟩</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">end</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">-- idea: fs stores term identifiers used in the formula, as a String/Nat pair for its arity</span>\n<span class=\"n\">partial</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">denoteFolFormula</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Language<