    {
        "content": "<p>So what I have found, is that there is <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/blob/75adafcaf8c4a0fcde8e1508f503bed2263ab055/Mathlib/ModelTheory/Syntax.lean#L733-L733\">some support for custom syntax to manipulate BoundedFormula</a>, but the .all uses De Bruijn indices, which is not very easy to deal with.</p>",
